cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use clinops in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "clinops: Clinical ML Pipeline Toolkit"
abstract: >-
  clinops is a Python library of validated, reusable building blocks for the data
  engineering steps that precede model training in clinical machine learning:
  loading MIMIC-III, MIMIC-IV, eICU-CRD, and FHIR R4 data, physiological outlier
  clipping, unit normalization, ICD-9 to ICD-10 harmonization, gap-aware temporal
  feature engineering, and leakage-safe patient-level splitting.
authors:
